      g3Title: 'What you come to see',
      g3Body: '<p>People come to Nancy for Art Nouveau. Two museums, one villa, and façades still standing in the streets: [[page:artnouveau|the School of Nancy is walkable]], provided you know the order. Over two nights, [[page:weekend|the 48-hour itinerary]] runs the two days in the order they are actually walked. In early December the city changes register: [[page:noel|Saint Nicholas and the Christmas market]] fill the centre, and tables need booking before you leave home.</p>',
